# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages and Netlify.
#
# The app is client-routed, so /how-it-works, /app/predictions and friends
# exist only once React has booted. Without this rule the host looks for a
# matching file on disk, finds none, and returns 404 for every deep link and
# every hard refresh -- the app appears to work until someone shares a URL.
#
# 200 rather than 301: the browser keeps the requested path so the router can
# read it, instead of being bounced to /.
/*    /index.html   200
